{
  "format": 1,
  "name": "mysim_eq_ring",
  "spec": ["mysims 4.1", "mysims 4.3", "mysims 12.3"],
  "description": "EQ 87.5 at move-in fills the ring (index 0). Seven monthly steps see EQ 90, 95, 100, 100, 100, 110, 110; step k replaces entry (k - 1) mod 6: after step 6 eqDelta = 110 - 87.5 = 22.5, after step 7 (replacing 90) 20.0. The delta_eq field is written by UpdateVariables before the ring moves (section 4.3 order), so it shows 22 after step 7 and 20 at the next refresh.",
  "steps": [
